>  As I was trouncing through the world of nethack I had a 'shudder come over
>me' and I died of 'system shock'.  I was wearing a ring of polymorph but
>I still can't understand why I died.  Anyone have an explanation of what
>'system shock' is?

System shock means that the polymorph didn't succeed.  It also costs you
1-30 hit points.

Whether or not you get a system shock depends on how low your luck is.  Also,
if you are wearing a ring of polymorph control you will never get a syste
 shock.
